; Generated by tools/zgo_world_assets/gen_ltx.py; edit the generator, not this file.
;
; Wallmark sections, one texture each (textures\zgo\impacts). The engine
; R_ASSERTs on a section it does not know, so the scripts only use these.
; The textures are modulate-2x art (128 grey = no change to the wall).
; *_d sections use the same marks from zgo\impacts\deep\ (height in alpha)
; for the experimental "Deep impact marks" option; with the stock decal
; shader they look exactly like the plain ones.

